  "ingredients": [
    "4 medium potatoes, peeled and sliced paper-thin",
    "3 tablespoons salt, plus more to taste",
    "1 quart oil for deep frying"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/fyXaxx0UFUekQSm8C1fX-LQlDqc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/73135-homestyle-potato-chips-ddmfs-0270-3x4-ingredients-8ab45ea8d37c4182a4b4e9b2b86b1025.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/73135/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer potato slices to a large bowl of cold water as you slice them.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/J_ZQDwF0WAy5BuaxGivXrcHNzIM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/73135-homestyle-potato-chips-ddmfs-0273-3x4-step-01-d02b8f8d91b2407a8d66589934ac410f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/73135/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Drain slices and rinse under cold water. Refill the bowl with water, add 3 tablespoons salt, and put slices back in the bowl. Let potatoes soak in the salty water for at least 30 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/T0YAhHqRagvx2oJsuZEuI6VqSpo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/73135-homestyle-potato-chips-ddmfs-0276-3x4-step-02-3816c034e2944d1b9ed0f92265361432.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/73135/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Drain and rinse slices again. Pat dry.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/yZrKR9KsWD9j__9q3bu3V4FLfF4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/73135-homestyle-potato-chips-ddmfs-0326-3x4-step-03-f07297299f6149d88c831425da903e5f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/73135/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat oil in a deep-fryer to 365 degrees F (185 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Working in small batches, fry potato slices until golden. Remove with a slotted spoon and drain on paper towels. Continue until all of the slices are fried.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/H7agWA9b1dYpV83mUDBiT0oNy9Y=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/73135-homestyle-potato-chips-ddmfs-0337-3x4-step-05-8caa5c8bf9f041b7961819b9e7395817.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/73135/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Season potato chips with additional salt if desired.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/4c8EL1Mln2zZUZ3RZZOovsIJG7M=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/73135-homestyle-potato-chips-ddmfs-0338-3x4-step-06-6cbd224c61c54114bcb0ab8abc665423.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/73135/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
